,{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"state"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSubSelected"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":6,"id":"source-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"source"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"SubscribeSource.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SubscribeSource"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSourceValue"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"returns-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"call-signature-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Call Signature"}]},{"type":"code","value":"<TSubSelected>(props): unknown;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"type-parameters-4","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":6,"id":"tsubselected-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TSubSelected"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSubSelected"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"parameters-4","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":6,"id":"props-4","children":[{"type":"text","value":"props"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Omit"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/SubscribePropsWithStore.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SubscribePropsWithStore"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSubSelected"},{"type":"text","value":">, "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"source\""},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"returns-4","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters-5","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tfeatures","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFeatures"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableFeatures"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RowData"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tselected","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TSelected"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableState"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-alias-octanetabletfeatures-tdata-tselected","text":"Type Alias: OctaneTable<TFeatures, TData, TSelected>","level":1},{"id":"type-declaration","text":"Type Declaration","level":2},{"id":"flexrender","text":"FlexRender()","level":3},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":4},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":5},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"props","text":"props","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":4},{"id":"state","text":"state","level":3},{"id":"example-2","text":"Example","level":4},{"id":"store","text":"store","level":3},{"id":"deprecated","text":"Deprecated","level":4},{"id":"subscribe","text":"Subscribe()","level":3},{"id":"call-signature","text":"Call Signature","level":4},{"id":"type-parameters-2","text":"Type Parameters","level":5},{"id":"tsourcevalue","text":"TSourceValue","level":6},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":5},{"id":"props-2","text":"props","level":6},{"id":"children","text":"children","level":6},{"id":"selector","text":"selector?","level":6},{"id":"source","text":"source","level":6},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":5},{"id":"call-signature-2","text":"Call Signature","level":4},{"id":"type-parameters-3","text":"Type Parameters","level":5},{"id":"tsourcevalue-2","text":"TSourceValue","level":6},{"id":"tsubselected","text":"TSubSelected","level":6},{"id":"parameters-3","text":"Parameters","level":5},{"id":"props-3","text":"props","level":6},{"id":"children-2","text":"children","level":6},{"id":"selector-2","text":"selector","level":6},{"id":"source-2","text":"source","level":6},{"id":"returns-3","text":"Returns","level":5},{"id":"call-signature-3","text":"Call Signature","level":4},{"id":"type-parameters-4","text":"Type Parameters","level":5},{"id":"tsubselected-2","text":"TSubSelected","level":6},{"id":"parameters-4","text":"Parameters","level":5},{"id":"props-4","text":"props","level":6},{"id":"returns-4","text":"Returns","level":5},{"id":"type-parameters-5","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"tselected","text":"TSelected","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Type Alias: OctaneTable\\<TFeatures, TData, TSelected\\>\n\n```ts\ntype OctaneTable<TFeatures, TData, TSelected> = Omit<Table<TFeatures, TData>, \"store\"> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [types.ts:202](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/octane-table/src/types.ts#L202)\n\nThe table instance returned by [useTable](../functions/useTable.md): the framework-agnostic\n`Table` from table-core, plus octane's `Subscribe`/`FlexRender` components\nand the selected `state`.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### FlexRender()\n\n```ts\nFlexRender: <TValue>(props) => OctaneNode;\n```\n\nAn octane component that renders headers, cells, or footers with custom\nmarkup. Use this utility component instead of manually calling\n`flexRender`.\n\n#### Type Parameters\n\n##### TValue\n\n`TValue` *extends* `CellData` = `CellData`\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### props\n\n[`FlexRenderProps`](FlexRenderProps.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`, `TValue`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`OctaneNode`\n\n#### Example\n\n```tsx\n<table.FlexRender cell={cell} />\n<table.FlexRender header={header} />\n<table.FlexRender footer={footer} />\n```\n\nThis replaces calling `flexRender` directly like this:\n```tsx\nflexRender(cell.column.columnDef.cell, cell.getContext())\nflexRender(header.column.columnDef.header, header.getContext())\nflexRender(footer.column.columnDef.footer, footer.getContext())\n```\n\n### state\n\n```ts\nreadonly state: Readonly<TSelected>;\n```\n\nThe selected state of the table. This state may not match the structure of\nthe full table state because it is selected by the selector function that\nyou pass as the 2nd argument to `useTable`.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nconst table = useTable(options, (state) => ({ globalFilter: state.globalFilter }))\n\ntable.state.globalFilter\n```\n\n### ~~store~~\n\n```ts\nreadonly store: Table<TFeatures, TData>[\"store\"];\n```\n\n#### Deprecated\n\nPrefer `table.state` for render reads,\n`table.atoms.<slice>.get()` for slice snapshots, or\n`table.Subscribe` / `useSelector(table.store, selector)` for explicit\nsubscriptions. `table.store.state` is a current-value snapshot and is easy\nto misuse in render code.\n\n### Subscribe()\n\n```ts\nSubscribe: {\n<TSourceValue>  (props): unknown;\n<TSourceValue, TSubSelected>  (props): unknown;\n<TSubSelected>  (props): unknown;\n};\n```\n\nOverloads (not a single union) so `selector` callbacks get correct\ncontextual types in JSX; a union of two `selector` signatures degrades to\nimplicit `any`.\n\nSource **without** `selector` is a separate overload so children receive\n`TSourceValue` (identity projection). If `selector` were optional on one\noverload, `TSubSelected` would default to `unknown` instead of inferring\nfrom the source.\n\nThe **source** overloads are listed first so `TSourceValue` is inferred\nfrom `source`.\n\n#### Call Signature\n\n```ts\n<TSourceValue>(props): unknown;\n```\n\n##### Type Parameters\n\n###### TSourceValue\n\n`TSourceValue`\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### props\n\n###### children\n\n  \\| (`state`) => `OctaneNode`\n  \\| [`SubscribeStaticChild`](SubscribeStaticChild.md)\n\n###### selector?\n\n`undefined`\n\n###### source\n\n[`SubscribeSource`](SubscribeSource.md)\\<`TSourceValue`\\>\n\n##### Returns\n\n`unknown`\n\n#### Call Signature\n\n```ts\n<TSourceValue, TSubSelected>(props): unknown;\n```\n\n##### Type Parameters\n\n###### TSourceValue\n\n`TSourceValue`\n\n###### TSubSelected\n\n`TSubSelected`\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### props\n\n###### children\n\n  \\| (`state`) => `OctaneNode`\n  \\| [`SubscribeStaticChild`](SubscribeStaticChild.md)\n\n###### selector\n\n(`state`) => `TSubSelected`\n\n###### source\n\n[`SubscribeSource`](SubscribeSource.md)\\<`TSourceValue`\\>\n\n##### Returns\n\n`unknown`\n\n#### Call Signature\n\n```ts\n<TSubSelected>(props): unknown;\n```\n\n##### Type Parameters\n\n###### TSubSelected\n\n`TSubSelected`\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### props\n\n`Omit`\\<[`SubscribePropsWithStore`](../interfaces/SubscribePropsWithStore.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TSubSelected`\\>, `\"source\"`\\>\n\n##### Returns\n\n`unknown`\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` = `TableState`\\<`TFeatures`\\>\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: OctaneTable\ntitle: OctaneTable\n---\n\n# Type Alias: OctaneTable\\<TFeatures, TData, TSelected\\>\n\n```ts\ntype OctaneTable<TFeatures, TData, TSelected> = Omit<Table<TFeatures, TData>, \"store\"> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [types.ts:202](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/octane-table/src/types.ts#L202)\n\nThe table instance returned by [useTable](../functions/useTable.md): the framework-agnostic\n`Table` from table-core, plus octane's `Subscribe`/`FlexRender` components\nand the selected `state`.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### FlexRender()\n\n```ts\nFlexRender: <TValue>(props) => OctaneNode;\n```\n\nAn octane component that renders headers, cells, or footers with custom\nmarkup. Use this utility component instead of manually calling\n`flexRender`.\n\n#### Type Parameters\n\n##### TValue\n\n`TValue` *extends* `CellData` = `CellData`\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### props\n\n[`FlexRenderProps`](FlexRenderProps.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`, `TValue`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`OctaneNode`\n\n#### Example\n\n```tsx\n<table.FlexRender cell={cell} />\n<table.FlexRender header={header} />\n<table.FlexRender footer={footer} />\n```\n\nThis replaces calling `flexRender` directly like this:\n```tsx\nflexRender(cell.column.columnDef.cell, cell.getContext())\nflexRender(header.column.columnDef.header, header.getContext())\nflexRender(footer.column.columnDef.footer, footer.getContext())\n```\n\n### state\n\n```ts\nreadonly state: Readonly<TSelected>;\n```\n\nThe selected state of the table. This state may not match the structure of\nthe full table state because it is selected by the selector function that\nyou pass as the 2nd argument to `useTable`.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nconst table = useTable(options, (state) => ({ globalFilter: state.globalFilter }))\n\ntable.state.globalFilter\n```\n\n### ~~store~~\n\n```ts\nreadonly store: Table<TFeatures, TData>[\"store\"];\n```\n\n#### Deprecated\n\nPrefer `table.state` for render reads,\n`table.atoms.<slice>.get()` for slice snapshots, or\n`table.Subscribe` / `useSelector(table.store, selector)` for explicit\nsubscriptions. `table.store.state` is a current-value snapshot and is easy\nto misuse in render code.\n\n### Subscribe()\n\n```ts\nSubscribe: {\n<TSourceValue>  (props): unknown;\n<TSourceValue, TSubSelected>  (props): unknown;\n<TSubSelected>  (props): unknown;\n};\n```\n\nOverloads (not a single union) so `selector` callbacks get correct\ncontextual types in JSX; a union of two `selector` signatures degrades to\nimplicit `any`.\n\nSource **without** `selector` is a separate overload so children receive\n`TSourceValue` (identity projection). If `selector` were optional on one\noverload, `TSubSelected` would default to `unknown` instead of inferring\nfrom the source.\n\nThe **source** overloads are listed first so `TSourceValue` is inferred\nfrom `source`.\n\n#### Call Signature\n\n```ts\n<TSourceValue>(props): unknown;\n```\n\n##### Type Parameters\n\n###### TSourceValue\n\n`TSourceValue`\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### props\n\n###### children\n\n  \\| (`state`) => `OctaneNode`\n  \\| [`SubscribeStaticChild`](SubscribeStaticChild.md)\n\n###### selector?\n\n`undefined`\n\n###### source\n\n[`SubscribeSource`](SubscribeSource.md)\\<`TSourceValue`\\>\n\n##### Returns\n\n`unknown`\n\n#### Call Signature\n\n```ts\n<TSourceValue, TSubSelected>(props): unknown;\n```\n\n##### Type Parameters\n\n###### TSourceValue\n\n`TSourceValue`\n\n###### TSubSelected\n\n`TSubSelected`\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### props\n\n###### children\n\n  \\| (`state`) => `OctaneNode`\n  \\| [`SubscribeStaticChild`](SubscribeStaticChild.md)\n\n###### selector\n\n(`state`) => `TSubSelected`\n\n###### source\n\n[`SubscribeSource`](SubscribeSource.md)\\<`TSourceValue`\\>\n\n##### Returns\n\n`unknown`\n\n#### Call Signature\n\n```ts\n<TSubSelected>(props): unknown;\n```\n\n##### Type Parameters\n\n###### TSubSelected\n\n`TSubSelected`\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### props\n\n`Omit`\\<[`SubscribePropsWithStore`](../interfaces/SubscribePropsWithStore.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TSubSelected`\\>, `\"source\"`\\>\n\n##### Returns\n\n`unknown`\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` = `TableState`\\<`TFeatures`\\>\n"}
